<div class="lf-cover-title">Area入門</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">數格仔 · RectangleArea=長x闊 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下A冊 單元七<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> Area係P5/P6幾何題根基，呈分試必出<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>P3 Perimeter概念 · Square/Rectangle特性 · Multiplication<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 理解Area=鋪滿的單位方格數 ❷ RectangleArea公式 ❸ 區分Area與Perimeter ❹ 用格仔圖數Area<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T31 Area與Perimeter公式混淆 · T32 單位寫錯（cm vs cm²）· T33 格仔數漏
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>Square邊長 5 cm，它的Perimeter是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Rectangle長 8 cm，闊 3 cm，它的Perimeter是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>下面方格紙的Rectangle佔了多少個小格？（每格 = 1 cm²）
      <svg height="120" style="display:block;margin:5px 0;" viewbox="0 0 220 120" width="220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<defs><pattern height="28" id="pg" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="28"><rect fill="#FFF" height="28" stroke="#9CA3AF" stroke-width="0.8" width="28"></rect></pattern></defs>
<rect fill="url(#pg)" height="56" width="140" x="20" y="12"></rect>
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" fill-opacity="0.55" height="56" width="140" x="20" y="12"></rect>
<rect fill="none" height="56" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="140" x="20" y="12"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="84">5 格 x 2 格</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90,8,40)" x="8" y="40">闊=2格</text>
</svg>
</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>一個Square用格仔鋪滿，每行4格，共有4行。總共有幾格？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Perimeter = 圍住圖形的邊長總和。Area = 鋪滿的方格總數。兩者有咩分別？（用自己文字解釋）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：咩係Area？ <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Area</b> = 平面圖形所佔的<b>空間大小</b>。用<b>單位方格</b>（1 cm²）來量度<br/>
      ② Area睇「<b>鋪滿</b>」幾多格；Perimeter睇「<b>圍住</b>」幾長——兩者完全唔同！<br/>
      ③ Area單位有 <b>²</b>（cm²、m²）；Perimeter單位冇 ²（cm、m）<br/>
      ④ <b>數格仔法：</b>每行格數 × 行數 = 總格數 = Area
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap引爆：Area ≠ Perimeter！</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Square邊長4cm。Area=? Perimeter=?</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">Area = 4×4 = 16cm<br/>Perimeter = 4×4 = 16cm<br/>（兩個都一樣？）</div><div class="why">Area單位係cm²，Perimeter單位係cm。數值可以相同但意思完全唔同！Area=4²=16cm²，Perimeter=4×4=16cm。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div><div class="eq">Area = 4×4 = <strong>16 cm²</strong><br/>Perimeter = 4×4 = <strong>16 cm</strong><br/>單位唔同！</div><div class="why">Area=二維(cm²)·Perimeter=一維(cm)。絕對唔可以混淆！</div></div>
</div></div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="110" viewbox="0 0 500 110" width="500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#F0F9FF" height="85" rx="6" stroke="#3B82F6" stroke-width="2.5" width="220" x="15" y="10"></rect>
<text fill="#3B82F6" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="125" y="38">Perimeter = 邊長加總</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="125" y="58">圍住圖形外面條線有幾長</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="125" y="78">單位：cm、m（冇²）</text>
<rect fill="#F0FDF4" height="85" rx="6" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2.5" width="220" x="260" y="10"></rect>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="370" y="38">Area = 鋪滿的格數</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="370" y="58">圖形入面鋪滿幾多個單位方格</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="370" y="78">單位：cm²、m²（有²）</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：RectangleArea公式 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>RectangleArea = 長 × 闊</b>（A = l × w）<br/>
      ② 解釋：每行有「長」咁多格，共有「闊」咁多行 → 總格數 = 長 × 闊<br/>
      ③ RectanglePerimeter = (長+闊) × 2（係加）；Area = 長 × 闊（係乘）<br/>
      ④ SquareArea = 邊長 × 邊長 = 邊長²（Square係特殊的Rectangle！）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Rectangle長 6 cm，闊 4 cm。Area = ？cm²。用格仔圖驗證（6格×4行=24格）。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Square邊長 5 cm。Area = ？Perimeter = ？（比較兩個答案：Area=25cm²，Perimeter=20cm）</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最高頻錯誤：用Perimeter公式去計Area！Perimeter係「加邊長」，Area係「乘長闊」。邊長5cm的Square：Area=5×5=25 cm²，Perimeter=5×4=20 cm。完全唔同！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 單位錯誤：Area寫 cm，正確係 cm²！呈分試漏寫 ² 必定扣分。cm² 代表「平方厘米」= 邊長1cm的SquareArea。</div>
</div>
<div>
