<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><b>Area用Perimeter公式</b>：Square邊長5→Area=5×4=20 ❌</td><td>Area=5×5=25cm²。Perimeter先係=5×4=20cm</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><b>單位漏²</b>：Area寫25cm</td><td>Area必寫cm²。cm²意思係「平方厘米」</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><b>反求邊長用錯Division</b>：Area36÷4=9 ❌</td><td>Square邊長=開方根號36=6（因6×6=36）。Rectangle闊=Area÷長</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><b>給Perimeter求Area直接代公式</b></td><td>先從Perimeter求邊長或長闊→再求Area（兩步！）</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><b>數格仔數漏或數重複</b></td><td>有系統咁數：每行幾格×有幾行。用Multiplication驗證</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><b>Rectangle長闊調轉照乘</b>：長8闊3變長3闊8</td><td>Multiplication可交換（8×3=3×8），但理解上長係較長嗰邊</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><b>鋪磚題直接除</b>：60÷3=20塊（唔理闊度！）</td><td>要睇長要幾多塊×闊要幾多塊。或總Area÷每磚Area</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「正方邊長自己乘，長方長闊要分清。Area單位有平方，PerimeterArea唔好撈亂。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">辨形狀</div><div class="sdetail">Square→A=a²。Rectangle→A=l×w。睇清楚係邊種形狀！</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">搵邊長</div><div class="sdetail">Question直接俾長/闊/邊長，定係要先從Perimeter/其他條件計？</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">套公式</div><div class="sdetail">Area=乘。Perimeter=加。唔好調轉！單位寫²。</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">驗單位</div><div class="sdetail">cm²定m²？答案有冇寫²？數字合理嗎？</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h1">附錄：考後加強練習（S1-S6）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th>答案</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S1</td><td>一個Rectangle長 9 cm，闊 5 cm。(a) Area = ？(b) Perimeter = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 45cm² (b) 28cm</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S2</td><td>Square的邊長是 7 cm。它的Area是多少？</td><td class="lf-ans">49cm²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S3</td><td>一個Rectangle的Area是 48 cm²，闊是 6 cm。長是多少？</td><td class="lf-ans">8cm</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S4</td><td>教室長 8 m，闊 6 m。每塊地磚Area 2 m²，需要多少塊地磚？</td><td class="lf-ans">8×6=48m² ÷ 2=24塊</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S5</td><td>以下哪個單位用來量Area？(A) cm (B) cm² (C) cm³ (D) m</td><td class="lf-ans">B</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S6</td><td>一個Rectangle花圃長 12 m，闊 8 m。花圃的 2/3 種了玫瑰，其餘種百合。種百合的Area是多少？</td><td class="lf-ans">12×8×(1−2/3)=96×1/3=32m²</td></tr>
</table>
